        "title_paragraph_spacing": 20,
        "title_paragraph_spacing_mob": 20,
        "paragraph": "<p>At Luxe Sassy, your satisfaction is our goal. We accept returns of unworn items purchased from our regular collection within 14 days of purchase, less shipping costs. Items returned between 15 and 30 days of purchase may be eligible for an exchange. Luxe Sassy is not obligated to offer an exchange or store credit for any item returned more than 30 days after the date of purchase.</p><p>To qualify for a return, exchange, or store credit, the item must be received unworn and in its original condition, with original packaging and tags intact where applicable. All approved refunds will be issued to the original form of payment. Original shipping charges and return shipping costs are non-refundable. Special orders and customized items are non-refundable and cannot be returned or exchanged. Deposits paid toward special or customized orders are also non-refundable.</p><p>To request a return, exchange, or store credit for an item purchased through the Luxe Sassy website, you must first contact Luxe Sassy Customer Support at info@luxesassy.com or https://www.luxesassy.com for approval and return instructions. Any approved returned item must be shipped, prepaid and securely packaged, to the return address provided by Luxe Sassy.</p><p>The customer is responsible for the item until it is received by Luxe Sassy, including any loss or damage during return shipping. Luxe Sassy must receive the returned item within the applicable return period in order for a return, exchange, or store credit to be considered.</p><p>Refunds will be processed as soon as possible once the returned item has been received and inspected. Refund processing times may vary depending on the original payment method and the relevant payment provider or financial institution. Customers will be notified once their return has been processed.</p>",
